#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:3
#: c492e1df6a8747dc982b603445738715
msgid "SOC / 纹理响应（SOC / Texture Response）"
msgstr "SOC / Texture Response"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:5
#: 74322fe0ec0344259c00b36e12311197
msgid "**分类：** 磁性"
msgstr "**Category:** Magnetism"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:7
#: a9526a55fb5c44c483fdd57297a1bb75
msgid "这张卡做什么"
msgstr "What This Card Does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:9
#: 568636ea7a874c84b31be8ea53d5a2e9
msgid "这张卡为含 SOC 的能量或磁力计算准备两类有序路径："
msgstr ""
"Prepare two types of ordered paths for energy or magnetic-force "
"calculations that include SOC:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:11
#: 39207d4ac397439b9ca8034d652ac348
msgid "**全局各向异性：** 整体旋转输入自旋纹理，保持所有相对自旋夹角不变。"
msgstr ""
"**Global anisotropy:** rigidly rotate the input spin texture while "
"preserving all relative spin angles."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:12
#: f4be0acd54a34d79a75577609d9dc665
msgid "**有限 q 纹理：** 保留每个原子的磁矩模长，按 Bloch、cycloidal 或一般旋转平面重新生成全部方向。"
msgstr ""
"**Finite-q texture:** preserve each atom's moment magnitude while "
"regenerating all directions in a Bloch, cycloidal, or general rotation "
"plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:14
#: a79dba525a2c45d4b21ef1b906465501
msgid "有限 q 模式中的 `q=0` 是生成的共线参考帧，不是输入自旋方向的副本。"
msgstr ""
"In finite-q mode, `q=0` is a generated collinear reference frame, not a "
"copy of the input spin directions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:16
#: 88e71931a2a34778af47d9e28ad40aaf
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:18
#: 79af579d81db4db9bbf9cd9dbf93bf05
msgid "全局刚性旋转"
msgstr "Global Rigid Rotation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:20
#: f4ea03eb612e4848b5ca16756d78db61
msgid "所有磁矩绕同一笛卡尔轴旋转："
msgstr "All moments rotate around the same Cartesian axis:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:22
#: ff63d5626c6640c1ac61a2148d8a3b35
msgid "\\mathbf S_i(\\theta)=R_{\\hat{\\mathbf n}}(\\theta)\\mathbf S_i."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:24
#: b2d8edde62fe4059908c8dec6f2fec60
msgid ""
"因此 $\\mathbf S_i\\cdot\\mathbf S_j$、磁矩模长、原子坐标和晶胞都保持不变。启用时间反演后，再生成一组 "
"$-\\mathbf S_i(\\theta)$。"
msgstr ""
"Therefore, $\\mathbf S_i\\cdot\\mathbf S_j$, moment magnitudes, atomic "
"coordinates, and the cell all remain unchanged. With time reversal "
"enabled, an additional group $-\\mathbf S_i(\\theta)$ is generated."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:26
#: 290a038f06dc4de9b62e7fd801af76f6
msgid "有限 q 纹理"
msgstr "Finite-q Texture"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:28
#: c954fc61e6ba40df9db02635e3a34026
msgid "对原子 $i$，令"
msgstr "For atom $i$, let"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:30
#: ceb1674b81014a74b05fed8220a2732a
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\phi_i=\\mathbf q\\cdot\\mathbf r_i+\\phi_0,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:34
#: 02bdfa4778154d1ea9b896c5e427ef6d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf S_i=M_i\\left[\\sqrt{1-c^2}\\left(\n"
"\\cos\\phi_i\\,\\mathbf e_1+\\sin\\phi_i\\,\\mathbf e_2\\right)\n"
"+c\\,\\hat{\\mathbf n}\\right].\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:40
#: 7056942c76d04362a1815990c624b15c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$M_i$ 来自输入磁矩模长，$c=m_\\parallel/|m|$ 是沿旋转平面法向 $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$ "
"的归一化分量。$c=0$ 为平面螺旋，$|c|=1$ 时旋转平面分量消失。"
msgstr ""
"$M_i$ is the input moment magnitude, and $c=m_\\parallel/|m|$ is the "
"normalized component along the rotation-plane normal $\\hat{\\mathbf n}$."
" $c=0$ gives a planar spiral; when $|c|=1$, the in-plane rotating "
"component vanishes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:42
#: b6eb4cbdf8b04630a383a8e5fbb8d33d
msgid "三种几何的区别："
msgstr "The three geometries differ as follows:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:44
#: ae3515cd844f4a0b8936c8be62d63a65
msgid "**Bulk / Bloch：** 自动令旋转平面法向平行于 q。"
msgstr ""
"**Bulk / Bloch:** automatically make the rotation-plane normal parallel "
"to q."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:45
#: 58d97f22f7b440e8b331f5f3b1380ca6
msgid "**Interfacial / Cycloidal：** 自旋在 q 与表面法向张成的平面内旋转。"
msgstr ""
"**Interfacial / Cycloidal:** spins rotate in the plane spanned by q and "
"the surface normal."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:46
#: b5a48e33bbae47489896a99ef013ed8b
msgid "**General spiral：** 用户直接指定旋转平面法向。"
msgstr "**General spiral:** the user specifies the rotation-plane normal directly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:48
#: d33fe9837b4d43e7a8a35d8e4d9b81c4
msgid "有符号扫描使用 $\\mathbf q(s)=s\\mathbf q_0$；正负分支对应相反手性。"
msgstr ""
"A signed scan uses $\\mathbf q(s)=s\\mathbf q_0$; positive and negative "
"branches correspond to opposite chiralities."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:50
#: f2b9459100c241e6bf700cd233b6d172
msgid "q 与周期晶胞"
msgstr "q and the Periodic Cell"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:52
#: 4f95c66242484825b13b6c7e898e8364
msgid "新建卡片默认使用晶胞倒空间整数索引 $(h,k,l)$："
msgstr ""
"A newly created card uses integer reciprocal-cell indices $(h,k,l)$ by "
"default:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:54
#: 127c2c7d2019426a8280e0b85f71b46d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf q_0=h\\mathbf b_1+k\\mathbf b_2+l\\mathbf b_3,\n"
"\\qquad \\mathbf b_i\\cdot\\mathbf a_j=2\\pi\\delta_{ij}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:59
#: 8b0d4ffd34e04f979d5995f8da73784e
msgid ""
"因此 q 会随输入晶胞自动换算，并在周期晶格矢量上严格闭合。默认 `(1,0,0)` 表示当前晶胞的第一根倒格矢，不等于笛卡尔 x 或 "
"Miller 晶面法向；它也与默认界面法向 `(0,0,1)` 正交，所以三种有限 q 预设都能直接运行。"
msgstr ""
"Thus q is converted automatically with the input cell and closes exactly "
"along periodic lattice vectors. Default `(1,0,0)` denotes the first "
"reciprocal vector of the current cell, not Cartesian x or a Miller-plane "
"normal. It is also orthogonal to the default surface normal `(0,0,1)`, so"
" all three finite-q presets can run directly."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:61
#: 89a425ad4b894451815f4a5371b5e740
msgid "自定义 Cartesian q 时，闭合条件为"
msgstr "For a custom Cartesian q, the closure condition is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:63
#: 030d98833440421a897be8225a9221ed
#, python-brace-format
msgid "\\frac{\\mathbf q\\cdot\\mathbf a_i}{2\\pi}\\in\\mathbb Z"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:65
#: be595f51b96942d19d9440e40f19c552
msgid "对每个周期晶格矢量都成立。若不成立，应同时调整 q 和超胞，而不是关闭检查后生成带周期接缝的纹理。"
msgstr ""
"for every periodic lattice vector. If it is not satisfied, adjust q and "
"the supercell together instead of disabling the check and generating a "
"texture with a periodic seam."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:67
#: 77dcadddb247429fa3bb52c94bfaa7c0
msgid "输出数量怎么算"
msgstr "How Output Count Is Calculated"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:69
#: 9970cff576f941e2bfc25869afad5c14
msgid "设扫描含 $N$ 个坐标："
msgstr "Suppose the scan contains $N$ coordinates:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:71
#: 4e8ae4fa7eb9435e8043d627e1a03d33
msgid "全局各向异性：生成 $N$ 帧；启用时间反演后生成两个完整组，共 $2N$ 帧。"
msgstr ""
"Global anisotropy: generate $N$ frames; with time reversal enabled, "
"generate two complete groups for $2N$ frames total."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:72
#: 7e646523c88a49738e2d25ed721b9607
msgid "任一有限 q 模式：生成一个完整有符号 q 组，共 $N$ 帧。"
msgstr ""
"Any finite-q mode: generate one complete signed-q group containing $N$ "
"frames."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:74
#: 3a53c540493240fb8fde0610341ef96d
msgid "“最大结构数”必须容纳全部请求组，不会静默省略时间反演组或截断路径。"
msgstr ""
"`Maximum structures` must accommodate every requested group. The card "
"never silently omits the time-reversal group or truncates a path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:76
#: 60956d1ad5ac4d2da46314e6287996a7
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:78
#: 7397cce349e44808ab708f71fc9f4447
msgid ""
"若模型在 SOC 计算中不能稳定区分相反手性的能量响应，可先构造包含目标传播方向的超胞，选择 `Bulk / Bloch`，使用默认晶胞倒空间 "
"`(1,0,0)` 和 `-2,-1,0,1,2` 扫描。输出五帧分别对应 $-2q_0,-q_0,0,q_0,2q_0$；回填 DFT 标签后按"
" `response_group` 比较正负 q 分支。"
msgstr ""
"If a model cannot reliably distinguish energy responses of opposite "
"chiralities in SOC calculations, first construct a supercell containing "
"the target propagation direction. Select `Bulk / Bloch` and use the "
"default reciprocal-cell index `(1,0,0)` with the scan `-2,-1,0,1,2`. The "
"five outputs correspond to $-2q_0,-q_0,0,q_0,2q_0$. After filling DFT "
"labels, compare positive and negative q branches by `response_group`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:80
#: e7163ba6f46c4dd7a81b83106204fe06
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:82
#: c2523d7ca6884f6599a5ea8e349dd734
msgid "响应类型（response_kind）"
msgstr "Response Type (response_kind)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:84
#: b6fc846a7da9496ea5410100ddb9689e
msgid ""
"默认 `Global anisotropy`。可选 `Global anisotropy`、`Bulk / Bloch`、`Interfacial"
" / Cycloidal`、`General spiral`。"
msgstr ""
"Default `Global anisotropy`. Available values are `Global anisotropy`, "
"`Bulk / Bloch`, `Interfacial / Cycloidal`, and `General spiral`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:86
#: 0923432877d8475ba4c5681ca3897078
msgid "扫描坐标（coordinate_scan）"
msgstr "Scan Coordinates (coordinate_scan)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:88
#: 04aa3a2adad04d2f91975c0e38228603
msgid "默认 `-2,-1,0,1,2`。全局模式中单位为度；有限 q 模式中表示基准 q 的有符号倍数。至少三个不同值并包含 0。"
msgstr ""
"Default `-2,-1,0,1,2`. In global mode, values are in degrees; in finite-q"
" modes, they are signed multiples of the reference q. At least three "
"distinct values are required and zero must be included."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:90
#: e6cd9177518b419fb0679cc8a53a54d0
msgid "全局旋转轴（rotation_axis）"
msgstr "Global Rotation Axis (rotation_axis)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:92
#: 4b338479b920477495981f66ca210105
msgid "默认 `[0,1,0]`，为笛卡尔向量，仅用于全局各向异性。"
msgstr "Default `[0,1,0]`, a Cartesian vector used only for global anisotropy."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:94
#: 1152e8d297eb4b8197ed2d7e9aef4e70
msgid "q 定义方式（q_definition）"
msgstr "q Definition (q_definition)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:96
#: d7b0b88e35804963b8c28c0d8f6887a5
msgid ""
"新建卡片默认 `Cell reciprocal vector`；也可选 `Cartesian vector`。旧工作流缺少该字段时按原 "
"Cartesian q 恢复。"
msgstr ""
"A new card defaults to `Cell reciprocal vector`; `Cartesian vector` is "
"also available. A legacy workflow lacking this field is restored using "
"its original Cartesian q."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:98
#: 8d619efe287845d68c46f91d3dda6cdd
msgid "晶胞倒空间索引（q_reciprocal_index）"
msgstr "Reciprocal-Cell Index (q_reciprocal_index)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:100
#: f005928876594ef1b069dc47d334e8ba
msgid "默认 `(1,0,0)`。三个整数共同定义基准 q，不能全为 0；仅在晶胞倒空间模式下生效。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(1,0,0)`. The three integers jointly define the reference q and "
"cannot all be zero. Used only in reciprocal-cell mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:102
#: a12ac9ee53af45208394c7cf493b61f0
msgid "Cartesian q（q_vector_cart）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:104
#: 7685e363675042d4a155f59f50913528
msgid "默认旧值 `[0,0,0.1]` Å⁻¹，仅在 Cartesian 模式下生效。界面将其拆成笛卡尔方向和模长。"
msgstr ""
"Legacy default `[0,0,0.1]` Å⁻¹, used only in Cartesian mode. The "
"interface presents it as a Cartesian direction and magnitude."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:106
#: 9282015e93774af8ad1d459eebeedad9
msgid "旋转平面法向（plane_normal）"
msgstr "Rotation-Plane Normal (plane_normal)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:108
#: 251fdf4d10ea4dc9b1a7ed09c6fbbfd9
msgid "默认 `[0,1,0]`，为笛卡尔向量，仅用于 `General spiral`。"
msgstr "Default `[0,1,0]`, a Cartesian vector used only for `General spiral`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:110
#: f435e0b59ac6486fb851f1ad3003806b
msgid "表面法向（surface_normal）"
msgstr "Surface Normal (surface_normal)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:112
#: 8b11ce472ff64d9fb3ab28056919a606
msgid "默认 `[0,0,1]`，为笛卡尔向量，仅用于 `Interfacial / Cycloidal`；不能与 q 平行。"
msgstr ""
"Default `[0,0,1]`, a Cartesian vector used only for `Interfacial / "
"Cycloidal`; it cannot be parallel to q."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:114
#: aa55cdf597704a40b9065eeb8353ac43
msgid "法向磁矩分量（cone_component）"
msgstr "Normal Moment Component (cone_component)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:116
#: 5d1795945cfe4fa7839127a71ed081f2
msgid "默认 `0`，范围 `[-1,1]`，表示 $m_\\parallel/|m|$。它改变锥形开口，但保持每个原子的磁矩模长。"
msgstr ""
"Default `0`, range `[-1,1]`, representing $m_\\parallel/|m|$. It changes "
"the cone opening while preserving every atom's moment magnitude."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:118
#: e689e36103ec47ce9681edebf3b7ed42
msgid "初始相位（phase_deg）"
msgstr "Initial Phase (phase_deg)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:120
#: faf0fcee1432469d83c955e977952a46
msgid "默认 `0` 度。作为 $\\phi_0$ 加到当前笛卡尔位置计算得到的相位上。"
msgstr ""
"Default `0` degrees. Added as $\\phi_0$ to the phase computed from the "
"current Cartesian position."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:122
#: c664a44a455c495fb0cad97b729f8f80
msgid "时间反演对照（include_time_reversal）"
msgstr "Time-Reversal Counterpart (include_time_reversal)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:124
#: bcfc01ae49754da3859b85e5d83062e8
msgid "默认关闭，仅用于全局各向异性。开启后增加一组逐帧取负的自旋纹理。"
msgstr ""
"Disabled by default and used only for global anisotropy. Enabling it adds"
" one group in which every spin texture is negated frame by frame."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:126
#: b72d3aadb7084ee6a0d6117281be0db3
msgid "要求周期闭合（require_commensurate）"
msgstr "Require Periodic Closure (require_commensurate)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:128
#: 3b651356a873418390ae57fdc22a5d24
msgid "默认开启，仅用于有限 q 模式。Cartesian q 不满足闭合条件时明确失败；晶胞倒空间整数索引天然满足该条件。"
msgstr ""
"Enabled by default and used only for finite-q modes. A Cartesian q that "
"violates the closure condition fails explicitly; integer reciprocal-cell "
"indices satisfy it by construction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:130
#: 471d782c076c4e15b8973c3f3a7ea6cc
msgid "最大结构数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "Maximum Structures (max_outputs)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:132
#: c734f342d5d14fa4a0e344d1a736493f
msgid "默认 `100`。必须足以容纳当前完整路径；不足时运行前明确报错。"
msgstr ""
"Default `100`. It must be large enough for the complete current path; "
"otherwise an explicit error is reported before running."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:134
#: 31d4e84493014ae0a83ca0a0e4603588
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:136
#: abc70b0c01874226ad67a570c54d8f8e
msgid "**Cartesian q 无法闭合：** 切换到晶胞倒空间模式，或同时调整 q 和超胞。"
msgstr ""
"**Cartesian q does not close:** switch to reciprocal-cell mode, or adjust"
" q and the supercell together."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:137
#: bdb1df73595d4263a0fa760af2d303ac
msgid "**Cycloidal 模式提示法向平行：** 表面法向必须与 q 张成一个平面。"
msgstr ""
"**Cycloidal mode reports parallel normals:** the surface normal and q "
"must span a plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/soc-texture-response-card.md:138
#: 6fa87112ebc242248e07dd7f01b4bb5c
msgid "**q=0 与输入自旋不同：** 有限 q 模式重新生成方向，q=0 是同一生成路径中的共线参考帧。"
msgstr ""
"**q=0 differs from the input spins:** finite-q mode regenerates "
"directions; q=0 is the collinear reference frame within the same "
"generated path."

