msgid ""
"输出磁矩写入 `spin:R:3`，并记录可辨认响应类型的 `response_group`、有符号 "
"`response_coordinate`、`response_coordinate_unit`、`response_branch` "
"和任务来源。有限 q 的坐标单位明确记录为 `1/angstrom`；manifest 还保存 Cartesian "
"q、晶胞倒空间坐标、周期、手性、平面法向、相位和法向分量。有限 q 使用 "
"`response_probe=chirality`，目前用于响应分析或普通 E/MF 训练，不会激活只面向旋转路径的分组响应损失。"
msgstr ""
"Output moments are written to `spin:R:3`, with `response_group`, signed "
"`response_coordinate`, `response_coordinate_unit`, `response_branch`, and "
"task provenance recorded. Finite-q coordinates explicitly use "
"`1/angstrom`; the manifest also stores Cartesian q, reciprocal-cell "
"coordinates, period, chirality, plane normal, phase, and normal component. "
"Finite-q frames use `response_probe=chirality`; they currently support "
"response analysis or ordinary E/MF training and do not activate the grouped "
"response loss, which is restricted to rotation paths."
